{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initialEntities","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Does ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"text":" record changes — the data is already persisted.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"first-load","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" hydration only. Do not use this initializer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to “refresh from disk” mid-session by assigning into a live ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"state.items = EntityStore(fetched)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from a CloudKit re-hydrate action).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In-memory state may hold unflushed writes or live UI bindings; wholesale","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replacement silently drops them and surfaces as lost keystrokes. Use","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/merge(from:shouldReplace:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for that path — it records no changes and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lets you decide per-ID which side wins. Under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPersistentCloudKitContainer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the gotcha is especially sharp: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".NSPersistentStoreRemoteChange"},{"type":"text","text":" fires for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"local saves too, so a naïve “refresh on remote change” observer feeds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app its own writes."}]}],"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Entities sharing an ID are collapsed to the first occurrence. A store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cannot represent duplicates — ","type":"text"},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" holds one index per ID — and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"admitting them corrupts the index: the map would keep only the last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index while the array kept every copy, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" over-reports and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later delete orphans the earlier copy with no ","type":"text"},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entry at all,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaving a row that is visible in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/values","type":"reference"},{"text":" but invisible to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" and the subscript. Persisted rows can legitimately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"share an ID (CloudKit forbids unique constraints), so this initializer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has to be total rather than trusting its input.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreVyACyxGSayxGcfc","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"